insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The passage implies that convenience may encourage people to use a service, but it does not guarantee satisfaction in small communities, as described in a training program in a advanced academic seminar context.','The passage suggests that a convenient service can attract users without necessarily satisfying them.','The passage denies that convenience affects service use.','The passage says convenience always guarantees satisfaction.','The passage argues that inconvenient services attract the most users.','A','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_28", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The committee approved the plan only after several risks had been identified and addressed when resources are limited, as described in an evaluation report in a introductory academic seminar context.','The plan was accepted although no risks were identified.','The plan was accepted once the committee had dealt with the risks it found.','The committee rejected the plan because all risks were addressed.','The committee approved the plan before considering any risks.','B','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_28", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The decline in complaints was gradual, so managers were careful not to attribute it to a single change under careful supervision, as described in a committee meeting.','Managers blamed a single change because complaints rose quickly.','Managers ignored the decline because it was caused by one change.','Because complaints decreased slowly, managers avoided saying that one change alone caused the improvement.','The decline in complaints was sudden and easy to explain.','C','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_28", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The writer contrasts short-term popularity with long-term reliability after initial trials, as described in a student guide.','The writer discusses reliability without mentioning popularity.','The writer says popularity and reliability are exactly the same.','The writer argues that long-term reliability is impossible.','The writer points out a difference between being popular now and being dependable over time.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_28", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'Although science podcasts was initially criticized, later evidence showed that it could be useful when applied carefully in schools, as described in a pilot study.','Later evidence suggested that science podcasts, despite early criticism, may have value if used carefully.','The usefulness of science podcasts was accepted before anyone criticized it.','Early criticism proved that science podcasts had no value at all.','Later evidence showed that science podcasts should never be applied.','A','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_28", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The report does not claim that peer feedback solves every problem; it argues only that it can reduce one specific difficulty for adult learners, as described in a professional workshop.','The report rejects the idea that peer feedback can help in any way.','According to the report, peer feedback is not a complete solution but may help with a particular problem.','The report discusses many solutions but never mentions a specific problem.','The report argues that peer feedback solves all problems completely.','B','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_28", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
